.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH alpm-db-desc-create 1  "alpm-db-desc-create " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
alpm\-db\-desc\-create \- Create a DB desc file according to a schema
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBalpm\-db\-desc create\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Create a DB desc file according to a schema
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
alpm\-db\-desc\-create\-v1(1)
Create a DB desc version 1 file
.TP
alpm\-db\-desc\-create\-v2(1)
Create a DB desc version 2 file
.TP
alpm\-db\-desc\-create\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
